            <note corresp="#d443-f1" n="3" xml:id="d443-f1-content">
                <p>Documentation concerning each of these 21 NSC
                    Determinations, including country studies and supporting memoranda, is in the
                        S/S–NSC Files, Lot 63 D 351, NSC Determinations No. 2-8, No. 9-17, and No.
                    18-21.</p>
            </note>
